            "body": "$Auto-cuts on first open (and after Reset):\\n\\n- register clock/reset nets, controlled by `svsch.autocut-clk-reset` (default `true`)\\n- nets carrying UHDM `declaredNetName` metadata\\n- persists cuts through the existing manual-cut layout path\\n\\nVerification:\\n- `npm run lint`\\n- focused auto-cut unit tests (2 passed)\\n- broader merge/layout run: 65 passed; 2 existing parser-backed tests could not run without bundled Surelog\\n\\nCloses #94\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Automatically creates an initial module diagram layout when none is saved.\n  * Automatically cuts declared nets and register clock/reset connections for clearer diagrams.\n  * Added a setting to enable or disable automatic clock/reset cuts.\n  * Resetting a layout reapplies the automatic cutting rules.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved diagram handling around generate regions and cut connections.\n  * Prevented overlapping automatic cut labels.\n  * Improved label positioning while moving diagram elements.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Added coverage for initial layouts, automatic cuts, configuration behavior, and layout resets.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
            "changed_files": 145,
